base.rea
-3                     spatial dimension  ( < 0 --> generate .rea/.re2 pair)
1                      number of fields
#=======================================================================
# NekIBM IBM_test/fixsphere/Re100 at NekIBM's own resolution: 32 x 60 x 32
# elements on [-0.04,0.04] x [-0.075,0.075] x [-0.04,0.04], sphere d = 0.01
#=======================================================================
Box
-32  -60  -32                                        nelx,nely,nelz
-0.04 0.04 1.                                        x0,x1,ratio
-0.075 0.075 1.                                      y0,y1,ratio
-0.04 0.04 1.                                        z0,z1,ratio
P  ,P  ,v  ,O  ,P  ,P                                bc's  (3 chars each!)
